==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|krabbe}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|krab}}, {{cog|en|crab}}, {{cog|non|krabbi}}. Further origin unknown; either from a [[substrate]] language, or, if inherited, related to {{m|de|kerben}}. Compare {{cog|la|carabus}}.

